{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Document category code","Code specifying the category of a document.","User code list","Message function code","Code specifying the function of a document.","DocumentFunctionCodeList","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Document issuing date/time","Date and time the document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Document issuing location identifier","Identification of the location at which a document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","UN/LOCODE","Document issuing location name","Name of the location at which a document was issued and when needed, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","Authentication","Details related to the authentication of a document.","Actual authentication date/time","Date and time when this authentication was actually signed or otherwise authenticated.","Actual authentication location identifier","Identification of the location where a document was signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authentication statement","Statement providing proof that the document has been authenticated.","Document authentication location name","Name of a location where a document was signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authenticator","Details related to an authenticating party.","Authenticator name","Name of the party which certifies that a document is authentic.","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement indicator","Indicator of an additional statement.","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Crossing the border transport means name","Name to identify the means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","Transport means crossing the border identifier","Identification of the means of transport used in crossing the border.","Sea: ITU Standard or Lloyd's number\nAir: IATA aircraft ID\nRoad: national license plate\nRail: locomotive number","Type of means of transport crossing the border code","Code specifying type of means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","TransportMeansTypeCodeList","Departure date/time","Date and time of departure of the means of transport.","Conveyance identifier","Identification of the journey of a means of transport, for example voyage number, flight number, trip number.","Consignee","Details related to the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee name","Name of the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee identifier","Identification of a party to which goods are consigned.","International code list (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User code list","Address","Details related to an address.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country name","Name of the country or other geographical entity.","Transitional element","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","ConsignmentItem","Details related to an item in a consignment.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Commodity amount","Amount indicating the value of the commodity (not to be used for customs valuation purposes).","Classification","Details related to the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification identifier","Identification of the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification type code","Code specifying the commodity classification (e.g. Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS), Export Control Classification Code (ECCC), UNDG Code list, International Code of Zoological Nomenclature).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7143","Producer","Details related to the producer of the product.","Producer name","Name of the party or person who has produced the product.","Producer identifier","Identification of the party or person who has produced the product.","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Gross weight","Weight of goods including packing but excluding carrier's equipment.","Net net weight","Weight of the goods themselves without any packing.","Tariff/supplementary quantity","Quantity specifying the goods in the unit as required by customs for tariff, statistical, fiscal purposes or as indicated in \"type\".","Invoice","Details related to the information of a commercial invoice.","Invoice identifier","Identification of an invoice by reference number.","Invoice issue date/time","Date and time of issue of an invoice.","Type of invoice code","Code specifying the type of an invoice.","Issuer","Details related to the issuing party.","Issuer name","Name of the party having issued the document.","Issuer identifier","Identification of the party having issued the document.","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Rule of origin code","Code specifying the criterion of determination as to whether a good qualifies as an originating good in accordance with the rules.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Region of origin identifier","Identification of the region in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the purposes of application of the Customs tariff, or quantitative restrictions, or of any other measure related to trade.","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Shipping marks","Marks and or numbers on a transport unit or package.","UN/ECE Recommendation 15","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Type of packages identification code","Code specifying the type of package of an item.","PackageTypeCodeList","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him.","Consignor name","Name of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering transport.","Consignor identifier","Identification of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering the transport.","Event","Details related to an event.","Event name","Name of the exhibition in cases where goods are sent from the territory of the exporting Party for exhibition in another country and sold during or after the exhibition for importation into the territory of a Party.","Event type code","Code specifying the type of an exhibition event.","LoadingLocation","Details related to the location at which the goods (i.e., consignments) are loaded on to the active means of transport.","Loading location name","Name of a seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which goods are loaded onto the means of transport being used for their carriage.","Loading location identifier","Identification of a seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which goods are loaded onto the means of transport being used for their carriage.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR User code list","TransportEquipment","Details related to transport equipment used for the consignment.","Equipment size and type code","Code specifying the characteristics (e.g. size and type of a piece of transport equipment).","ISO, IATA, EDIFACT (8053 or 8155) OR User code list","Seal","Details related to the seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment, used to secure an object and protect from unauthorized entry or tampering.","Seal identifier","Identification of a seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment by number.","UnloadingLocation","Details related to the location at which the goods (i.e., consignment) are unloaded from the active means of transport having been used for their carriage.","Unloading location name","Name of the unloading location, seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which the cargo is to be unloaded from the means of transport having been used for their carriage.","Unloading location identifier","Identification of a seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which goods are unloaded from the means of transport having been used for their carriage.","UN/LOCODE + User codes"],"root":{"s":"LPCO","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","g":"lpco","w":"74B","u":"0001L","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/LPCO","src":"BIP LPCO:4","k":[{"s":"category","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"categoryCode","x":"CategoryCode","f":"an..3","w":"D031","u":"0001L","q":"3","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/authorizationholderCategoryCode","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/external/user-code-list","ln":4,"ub":["coo-wco-tcro"],"src":"BIP LPCO:67"},{"s":"function","n":5,"d":6,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"functionCode","x":"FunctionCode","f":"n..2","w":"D046","u":"0001L","q":"6","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/documentFunctionCode","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/document-function-code-list","ln":7,"ub":["coo-wco-tcro","customs-bond"],"src":"BIP LPCO:536"},{"s":"identification","n":8,"d":9,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"id","x":"ID","f":"an..70","r":10,"w":"D014","u":"0001L","q":"9","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/identificationIdentifier","ub":["coo-wco-tcro"],"src":"BIP LPCO:540"},{"s":"issue","n":11,"d":12,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"issueDateTime","x":"IssueDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D011","u":"0001L","q":"10","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/issueDateTime","ub":["coo-wco-tcro"],"src":"BIP LPCO:550"},{"s":"issueLocation","n":13,"d":14,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"issueLocationId","x":"IssueLocationID","f":"an..5","w":"D012","u":"0001L","q":"11","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/issueLocationIdentifier","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/external/un-locode-list","ln":15,"ub":["coo-wco-tcro"],"src":"BIP LPCO:551"},{"s":"issueLocationName","n":16,"d":17,"t":"E","c":"0..1","g":"issueLocationName","x":"IssueLocationName","f":"an..256","w":"D034","u":"0001L","q":"12","v":"ht